@startuml Addresses Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Addresses — internal persistence flow

participant "Children / Clubs service" as Caller
participant "Create / Get / Update AddressService" as Service
database "MySQL\nAddressesRepository" as Repository

Caller -> Service : build, load or merge address
alt New address
  Service -> Repository : create and save AddressEntity
else Existing address
  Service -> Repository : findById or save merged fields
end
Repository --> Caller : AddressEntity

note over Caller, Repository
  AddressesModule has no public controller.
  Address changes occur inside the owning feature flow.
end note
@enduml
